Z||000002||mrfiero||04-21-2000||05:11 PM||||My Fiero (at least one of them) is the black '88 GT (Mike).  You can't make it out in the picture, but the license plate says "MRFIERO", thus that is my handle.<P>The bras on Deron's and John's cars are by Le Bra.  I just bought one for my GT at Checker Auto (Kragen or Schucks in other parts of the country).  I paid $60 for it, so it's not cheap, but it will protect the nose from rock chips, which in Denver is year 'round!<P>I'm inviting anyone in the Denver area (or anyone making a trip to Colorado) to pay us a visit. Our meetings are on the second Sunday of each month.  E-mail me for more info and/or directions.<P>Thanks for posting the pics Wayne.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 04-21-2000).]||||reg||10
